00:06:23.079 --> 00:06:27.112
<v Host>Time for a short quiz. Listen and try to answer.

00:06:27.711 --> 00:06:32.920
<v Slow>ゾウの赤ちゃんは、いつ生まれましたか。

00:06:33.720 --> 00:06:38.759
<v Host>Early in the morning on August twenty-second, at Himeji Central Park.

00:06:39.360 --> 00:06:45.216
<v Slow>お母さんのシューティは、どこから来ましたか。

00:06:46.016 --> 00:06:49.327
<v Host>She came from India, in July last year.

00:06:49.927 --> 00:06:58.016
<v Slow>ゾウの赤ちゃんは、お母さんのおなかの中に、どのくらいいますか。

00:06:58.815 --> 00:07:01.672
<v Host>About twenty-two months — almost two years.

00:07:02.271 --> 00:07:10.384
<v Host>That's all for today. The baby elephant cannot meet visitors yet, but I hope we can all see her soon. See you next time!

00:07:10.983 --> 00:07:13.384
<v News>また明日。
